Package: concordance990
Title: IRS 990 E-File Master Concordance
Version: 1.99.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Jesse", "Lecy", email = "jdlecy@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: The Master Concordance maps xpaths in IRS Form 990 e-file XML
    returns onto a documented set of research variables and relational
    tables. This package holds the concordance as component tables (forms,
    parts, tables, variables, xpaths), builds the unified tidy concordance
    from them, and provides tools to validate it against filing evidence
    and to document every change from version 1.
